  m_Name: Highlands
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  projectName: The Highlands
  description: "In a world high beyond the skies is the home for angry little creatures
    called NEFs. Show your worth to other NEFs by defeating them on home ground with
    fun weapons and awesome ragdoll-physics. A multiplayer physics-based brawler.\n\nI
    handled all sound design, voice acting, and audio implementation via Wwise and
    C#, across a full iterative production cycle. Alongside audio, I took on project
    management \u2014 coordinating the team through Miro and Trello and organising
    a Steam Next Fest release. \n\nThe project taught a valuable lesson: we had polished
    a prototype before locking the design, so the team has stepped back to rework
    the concept with the existing assets as a foundation."
